SUMMARY:Roberta Gambarini and the Detroit Jazz Festival Orchestra
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - JPMorganChase Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Italian-born vocalist Roberta Gambarini is celebrated for her fluent bebop phrasing and was mentored by pianist Hank Jones\; here she fronts the festival's own house big band\, the Detroit Jazz Festival Orchestra.
